 "n01": {
  "id": "n01",
  "img": "n01.webp",
  "page": "biomanufacturing",
  "label": {
   "en": "Production chain",
   "zh": "生產鏈"
  },
  "read": {
   "en": "Panel (a) is the ReLEAF production chain: plant stresses, an AIoT sensor, a green light signal, B. subtilis carrying CcaSR, the hollow fiber membrane, protectant secretion, protected plant. Panel (b) is the mechanism: abiotic stress raises ACC, which ACC oxidase would normally turn into ethylene; ACC deaminase breaks ACC down before that happens, so the plant is spared the excess ethylene that stunts growth.",
   "zh": "(a) 是 ReLEAF 的生產鏈：植物逆境、AIoT 感測器、綠光訊號、帶 CcaSR 的 B. subtilis、中空纖維膜、保護劑分泌、植物獲得保護。(b) 是機制：非生物逆境會讓 ACC 上升，正常情況下 ACC 氧化酶會把它變成乙烯；ACC 去胺酶則在這之前先把 ACC 分解掉，讓植物不必承受那些抑制生長的過量乙烯。"
  }
 },
 "n02": {
  "id": "n02",
  "img": "n02.webp",
  "page": "biomanufacturing",
  "label": {
   "en": "Perfusion system layout",
   "zh": "灌流系統配置"
  },
  "read": {
   "en": "The perfusion bioreactor system layout. The culture loop is the familiar one: engineered B. subtilis under a green LED, peristaltic pump, sampler, in-line photometer, pressure sensing and a pinch valve for backpressure. What this diagram adds is the downstream: the permeate enters a separate delivery loop with its own pumping, pH monitoring and regulation, and connects to a hydroponic system or a soil sprinkler line. That is where the product actually reaches a plant.",
   "zh": "這是灌流式反應器的系統佈局圖。菌液迴路是熟悉的那一套：綠光 LED 下的工程化 B. subtilis、蠕動幫浦、取樣器、線上光度計、壓力感測，以及用來建立背壓的夾管閥。這張圖多出來的是下游：透過液進入另一個獨立的輸送迴路，有自己的幫浦、pH 監測與調節，並接到水耕系統或土耕的灑水管線。產物就是在這裡真正送到植物身上。"
  }
 },
 "n03": {
  "id": "n03",
  "img": "n03.webp",
  "page": "biomanufacturing",
  "label": {
   "en": "The unit as a sealed case",
   "zh": "密封機箱"
  },
  "read": {
   "en": "The ReLEAF bioreactor as a sealed black carry case with a handle, one side open to show the culture reservoir, the peristaltic pump, the hollow fiber module and the tubing. It is the biomanufacturing page's picture of the unit as built, as distinct from the commercial cabinet we designed but have not made. The point of the case form is on-farm manufacture: the protectant is produced where it is used rather than shipped.",
   "zh": "這是把 ReLEAF 反應器做成一個有提把的密閉黑色手提箱，側面打開可以看到菌液瓶、蠕動幫浦、中空纖維模組與管路。這是生物製造頁上「實際做出來的機器」的照片，跟我們設計但還沒做出來的商用機櫃不同。做成手提箱的用意是在農場端生產：保護劑在要用的地方製造，而不是運過去。"
  }
 },
 "o01": {
  "id": "o01",
  "img": "o01.webp",
  "page": "description",
  "label": {
   "en": "Forecast to leaf",
   "zh": "預報到葉片"
  },
  "read": {
   "en": "Plant stresses, an AIoT sensor that picks them up, a green light signal, B. subtilis carrying the CcaSR circuit, the hollow fiber membrane, protectant secretion, plant protected. Seven steps. It is the one diagram every member should be able to narrate without notes, because it names what senses, what decides, what makes and what contains.",
   "zh": "植物逆境、感測到逆境的 AIoT 感測器、綠光訊號、帶 CcaSR 線路的 B. subtilis、中空纖維膜、保護劑分泌、植物獲得保護。七個步驟。這是每一位隊員都應該不看稿就講得出來的那一張圖，因為它把「誰在感測、誰在決定、誰在製造、誰在圍堵」都講完了。"
  }
 },
 "o02": {
  "id": "o02",
  "img": "o02.webp",
  "page": "description",
  "label": {
   "en": "The four circuit modules",
   "zh": "基因迴路四模組"
  },
  "read": {
   "en": "The genetic circuit inside B. subtilis, in four modules. Module 1, PCB synthesis, turns heme into phycocyanobilin with ho1::pcyA. Module 2, light sensing, is CcaS in the membrane, switched on by green light under stress and off by red light when there is none. Module 3, transcriptional output, is CcaR and its dimer. Module 4 is the output: translation and the folded protectant leaving the cell. Module 1 is the one to be ready on, because B. subtilis does not make PCB on its own and without it CcaS cannot see light at all.",
   "zh": "這是 B. subtilis 體內的基因線路，分成四個模組。模組 1 是 PCB 合成，用 ho1::pcyA 把血紅素變成藻藍膽素。模組 2 是光感測，CcaS 位在膜上，逆境時綠光把它打開，沒有逆境時紅光把它關掉。模組 3 是轉錄輸出，CcaR 與它的雙體。模組 4 是輸出：轉譯以及摺疊好的保護劑離開細胞。要準備好被問的是模組 1，因為 B. subtilis 自己做不出 PCB，沒有它 CcaS 根本看不到光。"
  }
 },
